Mutations with respect to the reference sequence in each read were determined using a custom C program. Since the primary read maps to the reference sequence and the secondary read to the reverse complement, we searched for T2C and A2G mutations, respectively. To quantify the sequencing error rate \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
